                        LIGHTSPEED NOTES - 461.01
                        -------------------------

1) After you hit Alt/J (for joystick re-centering), you must immediately
"stir" your joystick, moving it to all four corner positions.

2) Some new players have experienced difficulty in finding the Blaster Turret.
From the main cockpit, hit the space bar.  This brings you directly to the
Blaster Turret.

3) A new feature has been added to the Navigation Starmap.  Pressing the "H"
key will automatically target your Home Base, for convenience in navigation.

4) When in Practice Combat or View Starships, the Escape key will return you
to the main menu.  If in Practice Combat, you must be at the main cockpit
for Escape to work.

5) Games can only be saved and loaded when you are not in combat.

6) A new feature has been added to the combat screens.  When in the main
cockpit, the blaster turret, or a fighter or kamikaze cockpit, hitting "Z"
and "X" will zoom and unzoom the radar scope, permitting you to see further
or zoom in closer for greater detail, at your option.

